cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as well as the associated article."
title: "Foundational basis of resource physical value: chemical exergy, concentration energy and statistical entropy calculations"
abstract: "Supporting data and code (Online Resource 4) for the critical review 'Resource Assessment methods in Industrial Ecology and Process Engineering: a critical review towards improved consideration in LCA'. Contains Jupyter notebooks computing standard reference species chemical exergy (Figs. 4-5), statistical entropy visualisations, and Cumulative Exergy Demand calculations."
